WEBVTT

00:00:01.028 --> 00:00:10.228
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:00:11.038 --> 00:00:21.238
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:00:25.818 --> 00:00:30.718
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:32.218 --> 00:00:37.178
The sunset makes the vast
ocean a beautiful crimson shade.

00:00:37.298 --> 00:00:39.228
A wonderful freefall.

00:00:39.558 --> 00:00:43.518
I just want the wind
to take me somewhere far away.

00:00:45.268 --> 00:00:48.398
I always cleared
impossible hurdles before...

00:00:48.808 --> 00:00:52.608
...just by concentrating
because I didn't want to lose yet.

00:00:54.278 --> 00:01:00.278
But who's to blame when
it's not the best that I can achieve?

00:01:02.618 --> 00:01:08.958
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:01:09.828 --> 00:01:15.958
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:01:16.168 --> 00:01:21.438
Take the map in your heart,
the one that will not fade...

00:01:21.538 --> 00:01:24.598
...and hold it up to the light.

00:01:33.588 --> 00:01:38.278
Hikaru Shidou,
Umi Ryuuzaki, and Fuu Hououji...

00:01:38.858 --> 00:01:42.658
The three were summoned by Princess
Emeraude to become Magic Knights...

00:01:42.828 --> 00:01:45.128
...and save another
world called Cephiro.

00:01:52.468 --> 00:01:55.628
It was a world of terror,
full of monsters...

00:01:55.838 --> 00:01:58.638
...under the rule of
High Priest Zagato.

00:02:00.808 --> 00:02:02.438
I will go first.

00:02:06.518 --> 00:02:10.448
Hikaru and company parted with
Ferio, who saved their lives...

00:02:10.558 --> 00:02:14.918
...and hurried on their way to
the legendary Spring of Eterna...

00:02:15.028 --> 00:02:17.618
...in search of the ore called escudo.

00:02:22.198 --> 00:02:28.158
Alcyone, the Vengeful Sorceress

00:02:36.878 --> 00:02:37.968
Mokona!

00:02:39.378 --> 00:02:40.818
Wait for us!

00:02:44.958 --> 00:02:47.518
N-No use hurrying so much...

00:02:51.158 --> 00:02:53.648
Exactly where
is Sir Mokona headed?

00:02:54.398 --> 00:02:55.528
I know!

00:02:55.628 --> 00:02:58.188
We're out of the Forest of Silence!

00:02:58.298 --> 00:03:00.738
That means we can use magic now!

00:03:03.278 --> 00:03:05.608
Fly away! Fly away!

00:03:06.138 --> 00:03:09.138
Let's fly away to
the spring called Eterna!

00:03:16.718 --> 00:03:20.208
Fly here! Fly here,
the spring called Eterna!

00:03:21.388 --> 00:03:25.828
U-Umi, you have to learn
how to use magic from Clef...

00:03:26.128 --> 00:03:29.428
Right. I have not learned either.

00:03:30.468 --> 00:03:34.098
But remember that Clef
was defeated by the enemy.

00:03:34.508 --> 00:03:37.698
So we'll have to fight
the rest of the way without magic?

00:03:37.808 --> 00:03:40.508
Oh, it'll be all right, Umi!

00:03:40.608 --> 00:03:42.308
I can use magic!

00:03:42.548 --> 00:03:43.908
Oh, come on...

00:03:48.588 --> 00:03:49.548
Mokona.

00:03:53.118 --> 00:03:55.088
It might be a monster.

00:03:55.628 --> 00:03:57.928
It did not have to visit us...

00:04:14.348 --> 00:04:15.538
It's coming.

00:04:23.318 --> 00:04:24.348
Fuu!

00:04:26.728 --> 00:04:27.618
Ms. Umi!

00:04:27.688 --> 00:04:30.288
No!

00:04:31.328 --> 00:04:32.258
Umi!

00:04:36.468 --> 00:04:37.458
Fuu!

00:04:50.818 --> 00:04:52.748
Guys, where are you?

00:04:54.018 --> 00:04:54.988
Umi!

00:04:55.448 --> 00:04:56.918
Fuu!

00:05:06.668 --> 00:05:08.628
You!

00:05:09.468 --> 00:05:12.488
Give back Umi and Fuu right now!

00:05:25.448 --> 00:05:27.178
Fuu! Umi!

00:05:29.618 --> 00:05:31.088
Ms. Hikaru...

00:05:31.188 --> 00:05:32.088
Hikaru...

00:05:33.558 --> 00:05:34.858
I'll free you.

00:05:35.658 --> 00:05:37.988
Flame Arrow!

00:06:05.118 --> 00:06:06.608
Fuu! Umi!

00:06:09.488 --> 00:06:10.958
That was painful.

00:06:11.458 --> 00:06:14.058
Thank goodness. Thank goodness...

00:06:14.628 --> 00:06:16.598
Thank you, Ms. Hikaru.

00:06:17.568 --> 00:06:21.128
If I could use magic,
I could've gotten it myself...

00:06:21.708 --> 00:06:25.228
Well, at least now
I know how my laundry feels.

00:06:25.378 --> 00:06:26.338
Come on!

00:06:27.948 --> 00:06:28.998
What was that?

00:06:29.108 --> 00:06:30.478
Maybe another monster!

00:06:30.578 --> 00:06:34.178
You've got to be kidding!
Why are there so many?

00:06:34.288 --> 00:06:37.148
At this rate, we will not last very long.

00:06:40.958 --> 00:06:42.818
Mokona, you're all right!

00:06:42.928 --> 00:06:46.288
We should follow that example
and hurry to the Spring of Eterna.

00:06:46.658 --> 00:06:47.628
Agreed!

00:07:03.848 --> 00:07:05.578
This town sure seems deserted.

00:07:06.018 --> 00:07:07.808
I wonder if everyone's gone.

00:07:09.048 --> 00:07:10.148
Maybe...

00:07:12.388 --> 00:07:13.358
Maybe?

00:07:13.888 --> 00:07:15.588
Clef was saying...

00:07:16.258 --> 00:07:22.168
Because of Zagato, Cephiro became
a land where monsters roamed.

00:07:24.668 --> 00:07:25.798
I see.

00:07:26.598 --> 00:07:28.038
So this town...

00:07:33.208 --> 00:07:34.938
W-What...

00:07:35.948 --> 00:07:37.778
...is this?

00:07:39.378 --> 00:07:40.818
Perhaps we...

00:07:41.518 --> 00:07:43.538
...fell into a trap?

00:07:43.918 --> 00:07:46.188
There's no perhaps about it!

00:07:48.358 --> 00:07:50.358
Now I know how a fish feels...

00:07:50.358 --> 00:07:52.058
Now I know how a fish feels...
Fuu!

00:08:01.968 --> 00:08:04.408
All the villagers are here...

00:08:06.008 --> 00:08:07.498
H-Hi, everyone!

00:08:07.608 --> 00:08:10.908
We aren't bad people
once you get to know us!

00:08:11.018 --> 00:08:15.508
It's no good, Hikaru.
It doesn't seem like they'll listen.

00:08:16.188 --> 00:08:18.948
They do not seem
to be behaving normally.

00:08:20.758 --> 00:08:24.888
Stop that! It's not nice
to point sharp objects at people!

00:08:26.198 --> 00:08:28.128
He's going to use it!

00:08:44.278 --> 00:08:45.438
Hold on!

00:08:45.548 --> 00:08:49.508
This has got to be a joke! I can't
believe that all this time, we've...

00:08:49.848 --> 00:08:51.338
Hikaru, magic!

00:08:51.458 --> 00:08:52.678
R-Right.

00:08:53.088 --> 00:08:54.418
Flame...

00:08:57.058 --> 00:08:58.218
My legs!

00:09:10.678 --> 00:09:13.078
Stop!

00:09:13.408 --> 00:09:16.938
What... What are you
going to do, Ms. Hikaru?

00:09:18.548 --> 00:09:19.568
Hikaru!

00:09:21.518 --> 00:09:22.488
You!

00:09:29.828 --> 00:09:32.628
Sheesh!
What are you doing, Hikaru?

00:09:36.828 --> 00:09:39.628
It's because
you made it mad, Hikaru!

00:09:39.738 --> 00:09:43.638
But that girl would have
been killed if I didn't do that!

00:09:43.738 --> 00:09:47.178
I think Mr. Monster
was angry to begin with...

00:10:13.268 --> 00:10:14.328
Ms. Hikaru...

00:10:14.438 --> 00:10:15.428
Hikaru!

00:10:37.928 --> 00:10:39.118
I got it.

00:10:39.228 --> 00:10:40.598
That was splendid.

00:10:40.698 --> 00:10:42.668
Umi, that was cool!

00:10:48.368 --> 00:10:50.568
Did you get hurt, Hikaru?

00:10:50.878 --> 00:10:53.068
Ow...

00:10:53.678 --> 00:10:55.578
S-Sorry.

00:11:03.588 --> 00:11:06.558
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:08.628 --> 00:11:11.458
Everyone! It's all right now!

00:11:11.758 --> 00:11:13.248
It's useless, Hikaru.

00:11:13.358 --> 00:11:16.558
To them, we're
no different from that monster.

00:11:16.668 --> 00:11:18.528
Is this because of Zagato?

00:11:18.638 --> 00:11:19.658
He'll pay.

00:11:21.168 --> 00:11:24.868
Well, let's hurry
to the Spring of Eterna.

00:11:30.348 --> 00:11:31.468
Hikaru...

00:11:32.748 --> 00:11:33.878
Fuu...

00:11:42.458 --> 00:11:44.288
Umi!

00:11:48.528 --> 00:11:50.758
Umi... Umi...

00:11:54.568 --> 00:11:55.828
Umi...

00:12:06.418 --> 00:12:08.578
I was tired of waiting for you...

00:12:09.488 --> 00:12:13.388
...eggs from another world that
would've hatched into Magic Knights.

00:12:14.358 --> 00:12:17.158
You can't use magic
in the Forest of Silence...

00:12:17.258 --> 00:12:19.528
...so I was waiting for you here.

00:12:19.628 --> 00:12:22.998
To give thanks for
what you did to me before.

00:12:23.898 --> 00:12:26.338
Fuu, take care of Umi.

00:12:28.638 --> 00:12:29.998
Ms. Hikaru!

00:12:32.978 --> 00:12:34.408
How dare you...

00:12:35.208 --> 00:12:37.308
How dare you hurt Umi...

00:12:38.318 --> 00:12:40.978
You seem to be able to use magic.

00:12:41.088 --> 00:12:45.918
But as Master Mage Clef's pupil and
Princess Emeraude's sorceress...

00:12:46.018 --> 00:12:48.178
...can you defeat me, Alcyone?

00:12:48.588 --> 00:12:49.888
Princess Emeraude's?

00:12:50.398 --> 00:12:52.328
A pupil of Mr. Clef?

00:12:56.098 --> 00:12:59.998
If you're the princess's sorceress,
why are you standing against us?

00:13:00.768 --> 00:13:04.438
Didn't Clef tell you that
Cephiro is in trouble?

00:13:06.138 --> 00:13:08.008
Of course I know.

00:13:08.108 --> 00:13:11.378
But what does that
have to do with anything?

00:13:13.848 --> 00:13:16.878
She's the Pillar
that supports the world, right?

00:13:16.988 --> 00:13:20.248
The princess was abducted
by High Priest Zagato...

00:13:22.728 --> 00:13:26.388
I am working for Lord Zagato.

00:13:27.098 --> 00:13:31.658
I was able to wait here thanks to
the permission he had given me.

00:13:32.298 --> 00:13:34.128
Why are you with him?

00:13:34.868 --> 00:13:35.958
Because...

00:13:37.278 --> 00:13:38.708
...I love him.

00:13:39.708 --> 00:13:41.298
Ice Spear Attack!

00:13:44.418 --> 00:13:46.178
Ms. Hikaru, look out!

00:14:00.358 --> 00:14:02.058
You are nimble.

00:14:02.168 --> 00:14:04.928
But this time, it won't be as easy.

00:14:05.668 --> 00:14:07.898
You'll end up soaked in blood...

00:14:08.468 --> 00:14:10.768
...just like that girl over there.

00:14:14.508 --> 00:14:17.068
You hurt Umi.

00:14:19.578 --> 00:14:25.148
Fuu and Umi are
my precious teammates...

00:14:26.888 --> 00:14:29.858
...who fight with me here in Cephiro.

00:14:32.298 --> 00:14:33.558
Ms. Hikaru!

00:14:34.868 --> 00:14:38.028
Flame Arrow!

00:14:40.668 --> 00:14:44.538
The same trick will not
work against me twice.

00:14:45.238 --> 00:14:46.868
Barrier Circle!

00:14:56.348 --> 00:15:00.758
H-Her magic powers...
are stronger than before.

00:15:02.558 --> 00:15:06.928
Ms. Hikaru's will,
because Ms. Umi got hurt...

00:15:08.798 --> 00:15:11.268
...has increased
the power of her magic!

00:15:11.798 --> 00:15:16.428
To be able to strengthen one's
magic this much in such a short time...

00:15:16.538 --> 00:15:18.808
You are indeed a Magic Knight.

00:15:20.078 --> 00:15:23.668
However, you aren't
powerful enough to defeat me!

00:15:28.448 --> 00:15:31.108
Ice Blade Avalanche!

00:15:38.898 --> 00:15:40.658
You won't get away!

00:15:50.238 --> 00:15:52.678
Ms. Umi, are you all right?

00:15:54.678 --> 00:15:55.838
Hikaru...

00:15:58.248 --> 00:16:02.278
She is currently fighting that
black-clad, middle-aged woman.

00:16:06.258 --> 00:16:09.248
It's too dangerous
for Hikaru to fight alone.

00:16:09.358 --> 00:16:12.448
You mustn't!
If you move now, your wounds...

00:16:12.558 --> 00:16:14.688
But Hikaru is...

00:16:19.568 --> 00:16:20.758
Hikaru...

00:16:24.508 --> 00:16:27.138
Mokona, are you worried?

00:16:30.378 --> 00:16:34.818
I wish I had learned magic
from your real master...

00:16:34.918 --> 00:16:37.248
...that little imp of a mage.

00:16:38.218 --> 00:16:39.148
Then...

00:16:40.658 --> 00:16:42.748
...I could have saved Hikaru.

00:16:45.028 --> 00:16:49.328
Hikaru... saved me earlier too...

00:16:51.638 --> 00:16:53.298
I want magic...

00:17:00.438 --> 00:17:01.568
For Hikaru...

00:17:02.578 --> 00:17:04.508
Magic to save Hikaru...

00:17:19.398 --> 00:17:20.488
Ms. Umi!

00:17:20.898 --> 00:17:21.868
Umi.

00:17:22.428 --> 00:17:24.198
Can you hear me, Umi?

00:17:24.298 --> 00:17:25.328
Clef?

00:17:25.438 --> 00:17:26.398
Yes.

00:17:26.698 --> 00:17:30.568
Through Mokona,
I am speaking directly to your heart.

00:17:31.208 --> 00:17:33.138
You can hear me, correct?

00:17:33.538 --> 00:17:34.978
I hear you.

00:17:35.508 --> 00:17:37.998
Clef, you're all right?

00:17:39.918 --> 00:17:42.318
I was turned to stone...

00:17:42.418 --> 00:17:45.578
...but I can still
communicate with you.

00:17:50.058 --> 00:17:52.148
I want to save Hikaru.

00:17:52.998 --> 00:17:55.758
I want magic so I can save Hikaru!

00:17:56.968 --> 00:17:57.928
Yes.

00:17:58.438 --> 00:18:00.598
You wish to save Hikaru.

00:18:01.208 --> 00:18:04.438
You wish for magic
so you can save Hikaru.

00:18:05.838 --> 00:18:08.938
Can you feel it?
The power within you...

00:18:09.778 --> 00:18:13.268
There is a power
that you didn't have before.

00:18:14.188 --> 00:18:15.378
I feel it.

00:18:16.648 --> 00:18:18.418
It warms my heart.

00:18:19.388 --> 00:18:20.478
Words...

00:18:21.328 --> 00:18:22.788
There are words...

00:18:24.958 --> 00:18:26.988
That is your magic.

00:18:31.268 --> 00:18:32.568
This is the end.

00:18:32.668 --> 00:18:33.968
Chaos Hail!

00:18:35.108 --> 00:18:37.438
Water...

00:18:37.978 --> 00:18:38.958
...Dragon!

00:19:01.028 --> 00:19:01.998
Ms. Umi!

00:19:02.098 --> 00:19:02.958
Umi!

00:19:03.098 --> 00:19:04.998
Umi... Umi...

00:19:05.098 --> 00:19:06.228
Hikaru...

00:19:06.838 --> 00:19:08.808
Are you all right?

00:19:08.908 --> 00:19:09.838
Yeah.

00:19:10.308 --> 00:19:12.738
Because you saved me, Umi.

00:19:13.538 --> 00:19:15.138
You saved me...

00:19:16.548 --> 00:19:19.538
...with your magic, so I'm all right.

00:19:21.518 --> 00:19:22.648
I'm glad.

00:19:23.088 --> 00:19:24.548
Hikaru...

00:19:25.258 --> 00:19:27.878
...I just can't leave you alone.

00:19:29.558 --> 00:19:31.688
You're cute like a sister...

00:19:31.798 --> 00:19:33.558
So determined...

00:19:34.028 --> 00:19:35.458
Sir Mokona.

00:19:36.468 --> 00:19:38.058
It is my turn.

00:19:38.168 --> 00:19:40.138
Please give me magic!

00:19:40.238 --> 00:19:42.328
I want to save Ms. Umi!

00:19:46.438 --> 00:19:47.468
Fuu.

00:19:48.708 --> 00:19:50.678
Are you... Mr. Clef?

00:19:51.048 --> 00:19:52.018
Yes.

00:19:52.348 --> 00:19:54.368
Please teach me magic.

00:19:54.488 --> 00:19:56.388
Magic to save Ms. Umi!

00:19:57.048 --> 00:20:00.318
The magic already exists within you.

00:20:00.418 --> 00:20:04.418
Your heart that wishes for your
friends' well-being calls the magic forth.

00:20:04.898 --> 00:20:06.588
My heart...

00:20:07.128 --> 00:20:11.068
In Cephiro, one's will rules over all.

00:20:11.868 --> 00:20:13.858
The heart that believes...

00:20:14.468 --> 00:20:16.998
...becomes power in Cephiro.

00:20:17.538 --> 00:20:20.138
There are words
deep within my heart...

00:20:22.708 --> 00:20:24.938
Winds of Healing!

00:20:41.368 --> 00:20:42.458
Umi!

00:20:43.928 --> 00:20:45.128
Hikaru!

00:20:45.238 --> 00:20:47.758
Thank goodness! Thank goodness!

00:20:47.868 --> 00:20:50.738
It doesn't hurt
anymore? Are you fine?

00:20:50.838 --> 00:20:52.928
I'm all right, Hikaru.

00:20:53.038 --> 00:20:55.138
The heart that believes...

00:20:55.878 --> 00:20:57.308
...becomes power.

00:20:57.678 --> 00:20:59.338
Thank you, Fuu.

00:21:00.118 --> 00:21:02.778
Not at all. If not for your magic...

00:21:02.888 --> 00:21:07.148
...we all might have been
killed by that middle-aged lady.

00:21:07.858 --> 00:21:11.118
And thank you, Ms. Hikaru,
for fighting her as well.

00:21:13.758 --> 00:21:15.528
We're a team!

00:21:15.898 --> 00:21:19.628
The three of us are
Cephiro's most important team!

00:21:31.278 --> 00:21:32.678
For me?

00:21:40.788 --> 00:21:43.848
Are we still...
the same as those monsters?

00:21:45.428 --> 00:21:46.398
No.

00:21:47.698 --> 00:21:50.168
At least, not for that girl.

00:21:50.568 --> 00:21:53.628
We have gained
another heart that believes.

00:21:55.108 --> 00:21:58.558
This world still has flowers
that bloom this beautifully.

00:21:59.178 --> 00:22:02.698
Yeah. We have to bring
this beautiful world back!

00:22:02.978 --> 00:22:06.068
Everyone is waiting for that day.

00:22:06.578 --> 00:22:08.978
Let's go to Eterna!

00:22:09.088 --> 00:22:13.388
So that another day doesn't
pass before we bring peace back!

00:22:25.738 --> 00:22:30.168
Put the best smile
you can on your face...

00:22:31.738 --> 00:22:37.338
...and push down on that
pedal as hard as you can.

00:22:38.778 --> 00:22:44.348
Even if a really
strong wind blows against you...

00:22:45.088 --> 00:22:48.918
...don't give up hope so easily.

00:22:51.228 --> 00:22:54.388
Head for the big blue sea
that whispers in your ear...

00:22:54.598 --> 00:22:57.028
...what you really
need to know right now.

00:22:58.138 --> 00:23:01.938
Power that lets you
win over your tears.

00:23:02.968 --> 00:23:09.608
Now do the best that you can!
Your eyes will be someday soon...

00:23:10.348 --> 00:23:15.608
...basking in warm sunlight
and will start to shimmer.

00:23:15.988 --> 00:23:22.788
Just keep believing yourself
and never, ever give up...

00:23:23.288 --> 00:23:28.728
Your faith becomes
courage to live one more day.

00:23:44.208 --> 00:23:45.938
I'm Hikaru Shidou!

00:23:46.678 --> 00:23:50.078
We arrived at
the legendary Spring of Eterna.

00:23:50.188 --> 00:23:53.548
But on the little boat
we got on to look for escudo...

00:23:53.658 --> 00:23:56.248
...we were suddenly
attacked by a monster.

00:23:56.528 --> 00:23:59.328
The monster was hiding
in the shape of the spring.

00:23:59.428 --> 00:24:02.828
But Umi defeated
the monster with her magic!

00:24:03.398 --> 00:24:05.488
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:05.698 --> 00:24:07.368
Escudo, the Legendary Ore.

00:24:07.368 --> 00:24:08.608
Escudo, the Legendary Ore
Escudo, the Legendary Ore.

00:24:08.608 --> 00:24:10.368
Escudo, the Legendary Ore
You have to watch it!

